  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For the People</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a project primarily focusing on raising awareness and understanding of deforestation and green
growth issues.There are three components of the project. The first involves young Indonesians. A social media profile has been established that aims at engaging and inspiring young Indonesians. Through the digital platform supplemented by related TV content, young people can share stories, discuss topics and motivate each other to take action on issues
concerning deforestation and green growth. The second component is capacity building of programme-makers and journalists of local media organisations.The third component is outreach activities with communities affected by deforestation that address rights and sustainable livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
